<title>USA: ILLINOIS DIRECT HOGS STEADY/WEAK - USDA.</title>
<headline>ILLINOIS DIRECT HOGS STEADY/WEAK - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady-weak. Demand moderate. Top $56.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs. 55.50-56.50, some 55.00</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs. 54.50-55.50</p>
<p>Sows: Mostly steady. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-400 lbs. 42.00-44.00</p>
<p>	  400-500 lbs. 44.00-46.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs. 46.00-48.00</p>
<p>few over 600 lbs. 47.50-49.00</p>
</text>
